{"channelId":"UCDAdtRZqLIGlAr30p4XCbEg","row":["The Cat Rescue Files",82,"Please support our channel and cat efforts!\nWe take care of several colonies in our Shenandoah Valley community. 100+ cats are fed daily with adequate food and shelter throughout the community.\nWe trapped, spayed, and neutered, over 750 cats so far.  With over 400 adoptions. ALL of the cats that are spayed and neutered are taken care of or adopted out. \n    We are grateful for our supporters. And our local humane society for supporting our cause with free spay and neuter services!\n Follow us on our journeys and the ups and downs of cat rescue 💜 🐈","",""],"channelUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCDAdtRZqLIGlAr30p4XCbEg","biographySource":{"sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCDAdtRZqLIGlAr30p4XCbEg","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:11:11.084Z","channelId":"UCDAdtRZqLIGlAr30p4XCbEg","sourceType":"about","contentHash":"5fbda6f5cfd30307929cb1067a96e25e8c609fecdbbb44c8562e859f3c41be99","complete":true,"readStatus":"read","captureSha256":"24ab16e782c490c767ba6bd503cc022af07a3a54495c97d041742325d5ce97c9"},"countrySource":{},"followerAccounts":[{"platform":"youtube","url":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCDAdtRZqLIGlAr30p4XCbEg","identityStatus":"channel_published","value":82,"raw":"82 subscribers","precision":"exact","sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCDAdtRZqLIGlAr30p4XCbEg","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:11:11.084Z"}],"emails":[],"contactPages":[],"matchedKeywords":[],"relevantKeywords":[],"priorityKeywords":[],"quality":[{"keyword":"animal rescue","relevant":false,"evidenceLevel":"name_only","role":"undetermined","flags":[],"sourceUrls":[]}],"cleanup":{"status":"review","code":"biography_audience_review","reason":"简介上下文未证明本人与目标人群的关系；保留原记录，不猜测身份。","keywords":[],"role":"organization_self_report","excerpt":"g our cause with free spay and neuter services!\n Follow us on our journeys and the ups and downs of cat rescue 💜 🐈","sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCDAdtRZqLI